          "id": 2,
          "options": {
            "content": "**Purpose.** Follows the money: browse, basket and stock, checkout, then payment authorize and capture. Business outcomes per step, not just HTTP codes.\n\n**Use it when** checkout success drops or latency rises on the overview, or you need to tell *declined by the bank* apart from *our fault*.\n\n**How to read it**\n- Checkout row: success %, the outcome mix and latency against the 1.5s SLO. To find a slow hop, open the Service dashboard for cart, inventory or payment.\n- Payments row: declines are expected business outcomes. Capture failures and a growing oldest uncaptured age are not.\n- Basket & stock row: stock-outs (insufficient), cart failures and a falling catalog cache hit % come before checkout problems.\n\n**Background:** [Dashboard best practices](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/) \u00b7 [Dashboards that matter](https://kindatechnical.com/microservices-architecture/building-observability-dashboards-that-matter.html) \u00b7 [Navigation with links](https://grafana.com/blog/pro-tips-dashboard-navigation-using-links/)",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "repeatDirection": "h",
          "title": "",
          "transparent": false,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 3,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Checkout",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 95
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(checkout_outcome_total{outcome=\"authorized\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(checkout_outcome_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "success %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Checkout success %",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
